sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as DSH Agent
    participant P as dsh-mermaid-pele plugin
    participant E as Pele engine
    U->>A: Send message with ```mermaid fence
    A->>P: dispatch fence (lang=mermaid, settled)
    P->>P: gates: streaming? size? cache?
    P->>E: render(source)
    E-->>P: SVG (sanitized)
    P-->>U: diagram inline
    alt render fails
        P-->>U: stock code block (graceful fallback)
    end
